  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Video players no longer work in this open beta version. Only the instance master can put in a YouTube video in a player. They will see the video play, but no one else will.\n\nTo reproduce:\n- Get 2 players in an instance\n- Have the master put in a video in any player\n- Video will play, but only for the instance master. Nothing that other clients do will get the video to play for them.",
